<title>USA: Santa Fe Energy Resources signs Cote.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Energy Resources signs Cote.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe Energy Resources Inc said Friday it signed an exploration contract with the Ivory Coast to explore for, develop and produce oil and natural gas on Block CI-24 in the offshore portion of the country's Abidjan margin.</p>
<p>The contract provides for three exploration periods totaling five years and a 20-year production period.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
